*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Restores the native UIMenuIconWnd in the 2025-07-16    *
*                   Ragexe, appends a cloned native Auto Hunt UIButton, and *
*                   compacts visible controls into five columns. Complete  *
*                   one-through-six-row New/Classic textures replace the    *
*                   stock fixed backgrounds without runtime clipping. New  *
*                   UI also right-aligns naturally available Cash Shop,     *
*                   Gold PC Cafe, Roulette, and RO DEX windows below the    *
*                   minimap. Missing launchers are never force-created.     *
*                   Classic UI restores captured native positions. QJS-only.*
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

